msgstr "Canonical API name: `ptool.ssh.Connection:path`."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/ssh.md:369
msgid ""
"`conn:path(path)` creates a reusable `RemotePath` object bound to the "
"current SSH connection."
msgstr ""
"`conn:path(path)` crea un objeto `RemotePath` reutilizable vinculado a la "
"conexión SSH actual."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/ssh.md:372
msgid "`path` (string, required): The remote path."
msgstr "`path` (string, obligatorio): La ruta remota."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/ssh.md:373
msgid ""
"Returns: A `RemotePath` object that can be passed to `conn:upload(...)`, "
"`conn:download(...)`, and `ptool.fs.copy(...)`."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve: Un objeto `RemotePath` que puede pasarse a `conn:upload(...)`, "
"`conn:download(...)` y `ptool.fs.copy(...)`."

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/ssh.md:376
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/ssh.md:376"
